  ('d0b637fa-2ff7-4879-a423-854636d3d817', '379d3438-378e-46df-8cfb-eb6350bf4dc7', '14000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014', 'PHI-111126-207', '9772836924003', 'A Kid and A Comic Issue 23', 'A Kid and A Comic', '23', null, 'Various', 'English', 'Newspaper', 'Ongoing', null, 'Bi-Monthly', 'E – Everyone 5+ Suitable for all audiences', 699, 'A Kid and A Comic is a 16-page, full-size newsprint newspaper that brings back the magic of the classic Sunday funnies for a new generation.

Each issue features an exciting collection of 100% original comic strips created by today''s talented comic creators, delivering action, adventure, comedy, mystery, and spooky fun for readers of all ages. You''ll also discover brain-teasing puzzles, interactive games, activities, and surprises packed into every edition.

Whether you''re a lifelong comic fan or introducing someone to the joy of newspaper comics for the first time, A Kid and A Comic offers a nostalgic reading experience filled with imagination, laughter, and adventure.', 'A Kid and A Comic is a 16-page, full-size newsprint newspaper that brings back the magic of the classic Sunday funnies for a new generation.

