  ('993a424b-fcb5-4577-93e0-ea66f01412b7', '6918da47-bb9a-4019-9a4e-5fe0ffaaf61a', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-227', '79467734495500611', 'Caspian Porter #6', 'Caspian Porter', '6', null, 'Main Cover', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Limited/Mini-Series', 'CAS', 'Irregular', 'T+ – Teen Plus 15+ Contains moderate violence or complex themes', 499, 'The year is 2086. Caspian Porter works for the SMCI Corporation delivering supplies to colonies throughout the solar system. On a night celebrating his first delivery, Caspian makes two fatal mistakes. One, he drunkenly gambled away supplies for his next delivery. Two, he slept with his boss''s wife...big mistake. 

