  ('be5cdc1a-9adb-4722-81a7-5921c502a4cd', 'b742240d-17d7-48ad-9477-dbd192326faf', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-235', '85008822804500221', 'Let’s Hunt Monstas! The Series!!! #2 Cover B', 'Let’s Hunt Monstas! The Series!!!', '2', '2', 'Cover B', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Limited/Mini-Series', '228045', 'Monthly', 'T – Teen 13+ Suitable for teens, mild themes', 599, null, 'After his courier gig goes horribly wrong, Mr. Button is rescued by an old friend, Cap’n Mal and his band of Monsta Huntas.  Now burdened with the mysterious package, the Kid Cthulllu, Mr. Button agrees to work his passage to Safe Harbor and collect the coin on his strange delivery. Little does he know things are about to get really complicated.
Let’s Hunt Monstas! is a mayhem filled fantasy world where cuddly troubleshooting bounty huntas that are brought in to take down the worst monsta infestations.', 'Nick Davis', 'Nick Davis', 'Jeremy Ruby', 'CGN018000', null, null, 32, 'Full Color', 6.62, 10.25, 8, false, 1, true, 'Action & Adventure', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '85008822804500221', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":36,"product_slug":"phi121626235","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626235","source_barcode":"85008822804500221","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, false, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1VuSm6DE8c53Wkky1_Q6EiVblu4JjTl3N&sz=w1600', null, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1Wf9G8tQcKhMTRDu2Vl1prGClDss7DzNV&sz=w1600'),
  ('90e303d7-d639-4974-b33b-06b72b1f6a5e', '28bec1a4-b2a2-494b-9719-81b396305e58', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-236', '8600113150900211', 'As Above, So Below II', 'Premonition & The Fates of Destiny', '2', null, 'Marcelo Sanchez', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Limited/Mini-Series', '60011', 'Irregular', 'T – Teen 13+ Suitable for teens, mild themes', 499, 'In a time beyond Ragnarök, Zeus is dead, consumed by His hatred for mankind.  He sends a purge of fire to Earth before his demise.  With the imbalance between good and evil, cracks form across the Cosmic Egg of creation.  The Tree of Life, that grants life to all, slowly withers away. CHAOS, the Child of Darkness, is set loose, threatening to extinguish all life and light and plunge everything into nothingness.  Both Heaven and Hell lose sovereignty and evil spills out upon Earth.  The immortals begin falling one by one.  Desperation befalls the gods as they face extinction.  

The Fates of Destiny arrive at the birth of a baby boy, weaving their fate upon him only to realize his fate has already been woven with their own.  When the time is right, they will return to finish their web, thereby sealing his fate.
   
In the meantime, Chance, lives out his life in tragedy, unbeknownst of his life to come.  He lives a life of privilege until one day it all comes crashing down with the death of his true love and unborn child.  Consumed by anger and grief, he seeks vengeance and pursues the demon that destroyed his life.  

In time he becomes an old and broken man. Yearning to be reunited with his lost loves in the afterlife; Chance decides to end his life by jumping from a cliff.  At that moment, the Fates of Destiny appear with an intriguing proposition: if he agrees to assist them in the battle against the evil that plagues the Cosmos, they will reset his timeline and thereby finish their Web of Fate.

In a long succession of heroes, the Premonition power awakens across time when the Cosmos needs it most. The source of the power comes from the Tree of Life and is bestowed by the combined powers of the sisters of fate, the guardians of the Tree of Life. 
The Fates are seers of the past, present, and future and weave one’s fate at the time of their birth.  Rayvn is the weaver of fate.  Decima measures the length of the thread of one’s lifeline.  Morta is tasked to cut the thread of life, thereby sealing one’s fate.

Across the Cosmos, the former champion known as Premonition Omicron, has fallen. Finally defeated by henchman of Chaos, Manafest.  Premonition is defeated with the aid of Decima, the Fate of the Present, who has forsaken her sisters to join the fight against good. 
With Medusa now at the throne, Decima is promised a place in her dominion, leading to internal strife among the Fates of Destiny as they clash with Manafest.
With the death of Omicron, the Premonition power escapes into the Cosmos and takes with it the Fates of Destiny, who now bestow their combined powers onto Chance, and a new hero is born, the Yogen.   

He age-regresses to his younger self, becoming immortal– with one catch: his memory is lost, all but for his love.  The new Premonition grapples with a profound identity crisis, haunted by his true nature and lost love all while trying to learn his new powers, all in an effort, to stop the purge of fire from engulfing the planet.
Throughout this quest to reclaim his memories and understand his purpose, the Fates of Destiny reappear at different junctures, offering assistance and guidance to our reluctant hero.

Chance first finds solace in a gifted psychic, a descendant of the Oracle of Delphi, with the ability to commune with the dead and glimpse into realms beyond even Premonition''s reach. 
This psychic becomes an essential ally, helping Chance comprehend the extent of his powers and aid him in his quest for self-discovery.  He is later catapulted into the past with a misstep in his initial battle with Manafest into a time of the Vikings, where he learns how to fight and wield his powers with the help of his inner light, the Mind''s Eye.

Premonition later returns to the present after somewhat mastering his power and confronts Manafest and the purge of fire.  Other challenges arise. The fifth dimension is also threatened with the collapse of the third and sends its champion to combat CHAOS.  Later tricked by Manafest, our hero''s heart is tainted by darkness, and he joins evil’s cause. 
Morta, the Fate of the Future, escapes to the Gates of Hades and traverses the underworld to resurrect Premonition Alpha to combat the newfound evil Premonition, Dark Heart. 
Over several battles, our hero''s goodness is restored, allowing him to vanquish Manafest and other sworn foes summoned to defeat him.

This truly is a love story.  In the end, Premonition confronts CHAOS while fighting for his love.  Witnessing the hero''s unwavering devotion, Zeus regains faith in and love for humanity which breaks Him free from Cupid’s spell, which had turned him into stone.
With renewed vigor, Zeus joins the battle, helping to subdue Chaos and reinstates the delicate balance between light and darkness.

Chance is returned to his former life, before the tragic accident that claimed his wife and child, while still retaining the Power of Premonition, that he employs to prevent the catastrophe. 
 
Throughout the story, Chance grapples with internal struggles between darkness and light, and external conflicts that challenge his resolve. Despite his increasing power, it is not mere strength that triumphs over darkness, but rather the hero''s unwavering selfless love that ultimately saves the Cosmos as well as his soul and the lives of his loved ones. 

At the end there is a twist of fate where it appears this was all in Chance’s mind, as he lay dying, in the same car crash his wife and child die. But his wife and child survive, and it is their son that becomes the next Premonition.  Throughout the story there is many villains and side quests and lesser-known mythological and original characters interwoven in the story.', 'Consumed by anger and grief, Chance seeks revenge and pursues the demon that turned  his life upside down.  He later confronts him and is ready to give the killing blow that will deal his revenge when an angelic voice stops him in his tracks.  It is his beloved from beyond the grave that warns him to stop.  He reconsiders but it''s too late.  The demon wants to finish the fight which ends badly.  Chance is sent to prison for the accidental death of Carl.  In time he becomes an old and broken man. Yearning to be reunited with his lost loves in the afterlife; Chance decides to end his life by jumping from a cliff.  

Manafest, Beserker of CHAOS, has finally bested Premonition Omicron after 10,000 years of fighting.  His power escapes from across the Cosmos and travels to the next hero fated to be the next Premonition.  

At that moment Chance plunges over the cliff, he is blasted with the Premonition power and the Fates of Destiny appear with an intriguing proposition: if he agrees to assist them in the battle against the evil that plagues the Cosmos, they will reset his timeline and bring his lost love and child back from the dead and thereby finish their Web of Fate.

Confused with this new power, Premonition falls into a psychic shop and meets someone destined to help aid him in discovering who he is.  At that moment he sees his first "premonition."  

CHAOS is free to ravage the Cosmos until only darkness remains.', 'Kevin Crook', 'Marcelo Sanchez, Colors by Vittorio Astone', 'Marcelo Sanchez, Colors by Vittorio Astone', 'CGN004030', 'CGN004370', 'CGN004380', 28, 'Full Color', 6.75, 10.25, 2.8, false, 1, true, 'Fantasy/Superhero', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '8600113150900211', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":37,"product_slug":"phi121626236","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626236","source_barcode":"8600113150900211","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, false, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1Wbqu4Wn1v-t0hPp7w6QVhtHwRyBL2o03&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1QadavZijyaZfGMJY1NQf3wCWTvkG6958&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1WMKksizUn2ixpy7-VbrUOW4yBLpzdFmw&sz=w1600'),
  ('3ef48163-58fb-419b-920a-0384fcd93e85', 'f443d302-f378-4a30-b4c7-0a2bc9a37c7a', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-237', '7152412479460', 'LYNX', 'LYNX', '1', null, 'Mario Gully', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Ongoing', null, 'Monthly', 'T+ – Teen Plus 15+ Contains moderate violence or complex themes', 499, 'Mateo Martinez is a former Army Ranger. Maya Santiago is a kindergarten teacher. After Maya was kidnapped and Mateo was shot, the two dedicated themselves to patrolling the streets of Washington, D.C., protecting the innocent from violent crime. Together, they become the crime-fighting duo known as… LYNX!', 'The dynamic duo known as Lynx takes on the deadly Circus of Crime! But when Mateo heads out of town, Maya finds herself facing an adventure of her own. A night at the museum quickly turns terrifying when ancient history comes alive before her eyes. Meet Mummy Girl, a mysterious creature from the past who is about to become Maya’s newest nightmare… or perhaps her greatest ally!', 'Rik Offenberger', 'Milton Estevam', 'Mario Gully', 'CGN004080', null, null, 20, 'Full Color', 7, 10.5, 2, false, 1, false, 'SUPERHEROES', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '7152412479460', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":38,"product_slug":"phi121626237","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626237","source_barcode":"7152412479460","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, true, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1qaVZc1pid4JZA0M9qpgFV-TmSxhtCxqn&sz=w1600', null, null),
  ('0c40dc20-e845-4543-b9ea-ecd88bbb0212', 'f443d302-f378-4a30-b4c7-0a2bc9a37c7a', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-238', '715241248035', 'World''s Wonders Book One: Cataclysm', 'World''s Wonders Book One: Cataclysm', '1', null, 'English', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Ongoing', null, 'One-Shot', 'T+ – Teen Plus 15+ Contains moderate violence or complex themes', 499, 'Steel Wolf, Thunder Woman, and Midnight Owl first came together as “The Indie Trinity.” Their first adventure as a team “Operation: Krakatoa”, bringing the three heroes together for the first time. The adventure established the foundation for their team and their shared history, setting the stage for many more adventures to come.', 'When the villains known as THE CATACLYSM arrive on Earth, heralding an even greater menace, it’s up to Steel Wolf, Thunder Woman, and Midnight Owl to stand in their way! But is even the might of these three World''s Wonders enough to turn them away, or is this all simply the precursor to something far more terrifying?', 'Eric N. Bennett, Daniel Hoins, Cuong Nguyen, Henning Willecke and Scott Fogg', 'Henrique Pereira and Téo Pinheiro', 'Henrique Pereira and Téo Pinheiro', 'CGN004080', null, null, 28, 'Full Color', 7, 10.5, 2, false, 1, false, 'Superheroes', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '715241248035', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":39,"product_slug":"phi121626238","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626238","source_barcode":"715241248035","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, true, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1cBvqkg2kWviVBNN78VckqKyvxyYBvtLO&sz=w1600', null, null),
  ('d461d3fd-249c-4728-b554-9edd25baf8b0', '3811302a-dd82-4a06-985b-35afe4957c17', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-239', '199874665429', 'Nia Griggs & The Kemetic Sisterhood of Science #1', 'Nia Griggs & The Kemetic Sisterhood of Science', '1', null, 'Main Cover/ Andre Moore', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Limited/Mini-Series', 'NIA', 'Monthly', 'T – Teen 13+ Suitable for teens, mild themes', 599, 'When the world''s most dangerous tech falls into the wrong hands, only a goddess can make things right! Meet Nia Griggs, agent of the Kemetic Sisterhood of Science — on a mission to protect humanity ... even as an ancient evil secretly starts to re-emerge!', 'In our debut direct-market issue, we present two action-packed tales — pitting Nia and Kemetic Sisterhood against genetically modified terrorists, killer robots and more!', 'Carlton Hargro, Darrick Hargro', 'Bridgit Connell, Juan C. Baez', 'Andre Moore', 'CGN004080', 'CGN022000', 'CGN035000', 32, 'Full Color', 6.625, 10.25, 6.8, true, 1, true, 'Superheroes | Espionage', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '199874665429', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":40,"product_slug":"phi121626239","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626239","source_barcode":"199874665429","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, false, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1rvpWAUT8fNzEFJD6dj89wu_ckuTykUfy&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1z3KRL81-ECDp2MJ4gM_rdr5hQSBetqR9&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1HxhnU8j3lzCVt8pRio106CRWkL3R_7NU&sz=w1600'),
