  ('8bf2d3bf-66fc-4282-a713-8a0a39143e4e', '02466c1d-4e5a-4d57-908d-c7ff97599d91', '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'PHI121626-244', '9798997531423', 'Alpha Red #9 Direct Market Exclusive', 'Alpha Red', '9', 'Alpha Red 9 Cover F Direct Market Exclusive', 'Direct Market Exclusive by James Q. Nguyen', 'English', 'Standard Floppy Comic', 'Ongoing', null, 'Monthly', 'E – Everyone 5+ Suitable for all audiences', 599, 'This SUPER hero’s-journey follows ordinary contractor Calvin “Wes” Wesley as he finds himself called into the eternal battle between good and evil, becoming ALPHA RED!  Forty years ago, Satan was betrayed by his right-hand demon and cast into the body of a human, then cursed with immortality.  The Devil has been walking the earth for four decades plotting his revenge, but no one knows who he is or what he looks like.  Our hero gets a chip implanted in his brain that makes him super-strong, super-fast, and super-smart.  Wes must find the Enemy and stop him from taking over the world.  A cross between the Marvel Cinematic Universe, G.I. Joe, and Transformers, this story will make you laugh and make you cry.  It will have you routing for Alpha Red to find the strength to stop Satan and save the world!', 'Alpha Red finds himself in hot water with Peter, the Kingdom''s senior leader. Thinking he has a few days off to enjoy Christmas, he''s quickly reminded that evil never takes a holiday.
After enduring a grueling training session that pushes Alpha Red to his limits, Peter reveals a collection of top-secret files about Alpha Red''s parents. Long before he became a hero, they served the Kingdom as legendary superheroes—until they were killed in the line of duty when he was only three years old.
For the first time, Alpha Red uncovers the truth about his parents'' final Christmas Eve mission as they fought to save Diver City from Professor Polar, a brilliant but deranged scientist determined to plunge the entire city into an eternal deep freeze.
Don''t miss this exciting glimpse into Alpha Red''s past and discover the heroic legacy that shaped his future.', 'James Q. Nguyen & Ray MacKay', 'James Q. Nguyen', 'James Q. Nguyen', 'CGN000000', 'CGN011000', 'CGN004080', 24, 'Full Color', 6.625, 10.25, 44.8, false, 1, true, 'Superheroes', 'live', 'tbd', now(), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), now(), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), (select user_id from pg_temp.philbo_import_actor), '15000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115', 'PHILVIEWS #15 authorized production import', now(), '9798997531423', '{"source_file":"Philbo_Sept1catalog - Form Responses 1.csv","source_row":45,"product_slug":"phi121626244","direct_product_url":"https://philbodistribution.com/philbo-catalog/p/phi121626244","source_barcode":"9798997531423","source_printing_number":1,"imported_catalog_record":true,"authorized_import":"PHILVIEWS #15"}'::jsonb, true, false, 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=174kpgmDR-GX0UTZJLSPcXSmKlLe5xA9C&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1maew2zloCxjBPtqvmfkSzM6ZrKVbyJb5&sz=w1600', 'https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=12ddyLQ8EFI1b8LSIUIPcXAY-yxQ3fkIk&sz=w1600'),
